    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Radford are delighted to bring to the market this well proportioned deceptively spacious four / five bedroom detached double fronted property which is set off the main New Ross to Campile road.\n\nThe property is oozing potential and ready for a new buyer to make their own mark. Presented over two floors the accommodation is presented in good condton throughout and comprises entrance porch, entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining, sun room, utility room, guest wc, reception room 2 / bedroom 5, wet room, 4 upstairs bedrooms, main ensuite and a family bathroom. The house boasts double glazed windows, oil fired central heating, off street parking and easy access to the South Coast.\nThe garden is situated mainly to the front and the side of the property, laid out mainly in lawn with off street parking. To the rear there is a small yard which is fenced. There is also a boiler house and an outside wc.\nThis home which is just 8-10mins from several beaches of the Hook Peninsula, JF Kennedy and other popular tourist attractions while literally a minute from vibrant Campile village."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 2.59m x 2.47m\nTriple aspect room with tiled floor, wooden ceiling\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.47m x 2.07m\nLaminate flooring, ceiling coving and rose, under stair storage\n\nLiving Room / Bedroom - 4.28m x 3.8m\nPicture window to front, laminate flooring, feature fireplace with open fire, tiled hearth and inset\n\nWet Room - 2.5m x 2.46m\nFully tiled comprising \"TritonT80\" shower, wc, wall hung wash hand basinm wooden ceiling\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.38m x 3.91m\nfitted wall and floor units, stainless steel sink unit with double drainer, stand alone oven/ hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, fridge / freezer, solid fuel stove, tiled floor, tiled splashback, window to side, step down to\n\nSun Room - 4.37m x 3.25m\nVaulted wooden ceiling with 2 x velux windows, triple aspect, laminate flooring\n\nUtility Room - 3.94m x 2.51m\nFitted wall and floor units, stainless steel sinkunit with double drainer, plumbed for washing machine, tiled floor, tiled splashback, window to side, door to rearIncorporating Guest WC with corner wash hand basin 1.28m x 1.37m\n\nLanding - 3.61m x 2.93m (max)\nWith hotpress\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.31m x 3.78m\nPicture window to front\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.8m x 2.49m\nPicture window to rear\n\nBathroom - 2.76m x 1.69m\nSuite comprises bath with shower attachment, wc, pedestal wash hand basin, wall hung mirror with overhead light, fully tiled walls and floor,\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.35m x 3.81m\nPicture window to front\n\nEnsuite - 2.63m x 1.08m\nStep in tiled shower unit with thermostate shower, pedestal washhand basin, tiled floor, wall hung mirror with overhead light\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.53m x 2.08m (max)\nPicture window to front, built in storage\n\nBoiler House - 2.27m x 1.7m\n\n\nOutside WC - \n\n\n"
      },
